<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A5.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix E Additional Results ‣ Training dynamics impact post-trainingquantization robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Weight decay</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
