<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 19: </span><span id="A4.F19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Quantization degradation for OLMo-1B</span>. 3 and 4-bit quantization with GPTQ.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F20" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.06213v1/camera_ready_olmo1_7B.svg" id="A4.F20.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/165;" width="548" height="165"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 20: </span><span id="A4.F20.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Quantization degradation for OLMo-7B</span>. 3 and 4-bit quantization with GPTQ.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F21" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.06213v1/camera_ready_olmo2-1B.svg" id="A4.F21.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/192;" width="548" height="192"></object>
